WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.968
-Guys, as you know, every week,
we like to bring you

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:04.570
some uplifting, creative videos
wherever they come from,

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:06.705
from quarantine or just stuff
around the country.

00:00:06.705 --> 00:00:08.508
It's time for
"What Are You Doing Wednesday?"

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:09.675 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:12.044
♪ -What are you doing
next Wednesday? ♪

00:00:12.044 --> 00:00:15.548
♪ What are you doing
next Wednesday? ♪

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:17.683
-These are fun to watch.

00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:21.121
This first clip, this woman
decides to pull a trick

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:23.789
on her dog,
like feeding her dog --

00:00:23.789 --> 00:00:26.292
and just watch
the dog's reaction.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:33.166 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:40.006 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:41.173
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.173 --> 00:00:42.909
"Wait, what's that?"

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:47.513
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:49.915
The timing is perfect.

00:00:49.915 --> 00:00:51.851
"Uh-huh. Uh, what?"

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:52.852
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:54.220
[ Growls ]

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:58.158
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:02.462
This next clip, it's clearly two
friends going on a road trip,

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:05.264
but one guy decides to do
something to the passenger

00:01:05.264 --> 00:01:07.166
the whole trip
to keep him awake.

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:08.535
Just watch this.

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:10.803
-[ Screaming ]

00:01:10.803 --> 00:01:12.105
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:14.607
-Why? Again?

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:15.642
-[ Screaming ]

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:16.675
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.675 --> 00:01:19.611
-How many [bleep] times?
Let me sleep.

00:01:19.611 --> 00:01:21.514
-"Just let me sleep."

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:24.384
[ Applause ]

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:26.219
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:28.087
This next guy,
there's certain rules you have

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:31.190
if you're dating or if you're
married or something like that

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:34.994
that you don't watch the show
without the other person.

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:36.296
You have to watch it
with the person.

00:01:36.296 --> 00:01:37.897
It's just an unwritten rule.

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:38.998
You can't do it.

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:42.801
This guy found out
and busted his wife.

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:44.236
Check this out.

00:01:44.236 --> 00:01:47.439
-A fricken season is
what you've watched!

00:01:47.439 --> 00:01:49.041
-We've watched several of them.

00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:51.844
-Damn it! The thing told on me!

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:53.546
-Yes! Season 2!

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.348
You watched a whole season
without me!

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:56.849
-Well, I knew I had to stop.
-You didn't even tell me.

00:01:56.849 --> 00:01:58.117
-That's because it was so good
I couldn't stop.

00:01:58.117 --> 00:01:59.719
-You've been cheating on me.
-Yes, I have.

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:01.354
-We need marriage counseling.

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:04.724
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:07.727
-Finally, this dog owner
found a pretty good way

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:09.095
to communicate with his dog.

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:10.296
Watch this.

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:11.463
-Winston.

00:02:11.463 --> 00:02:12.498
[ Toy squeaks ]

00:02:12.498 --> 00:02:15.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:17.736
What's up, Winston?

00:02:17.736 --> 00:02:19.706
[ Toy squeaks ]

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:21.841
What are you doing?
[ Toy squeaks ]

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:23.943
Yeah?
[ Toy squeaks ]

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:25.844
That's cool.
[ Toy squeaks ]

00:02:25.844 --> 00:02:27.179
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:27.179 --> 00:02:28.648
-She had a good laugh too.

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:30.917
There you have it. That was
"What Are You Doing Wednesday?"

